(4317836, 623118, 44579, '<td valign="top">Couple of things for next time:<br/> <br/>1. I have absolutely no idea what this is.<br/>2. The light is really really harsh, which contributes to problem #1.<br/>3. The colors are just not very appealing. This is a big deal with most DPC voters. Do a search on the forums, there are certain colors that usually ribbon.<br/>4. The photo is not very sharp. This could be due to editing or due to a poor lens. If it''s a poor lens I feel for you. My Canon A85 had one of the worst lenses ever, and unfortunately, this matters on a site like DPC.<br/> <br/>I gave this a 3, so that''s why I left the comments, hope they help for next time.</td>', 'Couple of things for next time: 1. I have absolutely no idea what this is.2. The light is really really harsh, which contributes to problem #1.3. The colors are just not very appealing. This is a big deal with most DPC voters. Do a search on the forums, there are certain colors that usually ribbon.4. The photo is not very sharp. This could be due to editing or due to a poor lens. If it''s a poor lens I feel for you. My Canon A85 had one of the worst lenses ever, and unfortunately, this matters on a site like DPC. I gave this a 3, so that''s why I left the comments, hope they help for next time.', '2007-12-17 00:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
