(4318026, 622616, 68035, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge well.  I really like the composition of this shot and the use of the fish eye.  Love the fact that whilst you have got one of the viewers reflection in the glass, that the glass on the right of the frame is reflection (and thus distraction) free</td>', 'Meets the challenge well.  I really like the composition of this shot and the use of the fish eye.  Love the fact that whilst you have got one of the viewers reflection in the glass, that the glass on the right of the frame is reflection (and thus distraction) free', '2007-12-17 04:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4318028, 623028, 68035, '<td valign="top">very clever on a number of counts...yes receiving parcels from ebay DOES feel like christmas, also the light shining up from the box works well to convey the ''magic'' of christmas/ebay/receiving a parcel.<br/> <br/>Only minor issue would be that there appears to be a colour cast on the stuffing and bubble wrap (especially in the lower half of the frame) which to some extent makes the shot feel flatter than perhaps it should</td>', 'very clever on a number of counts...yes receiving parcels from ebay DOES feel like christmas, also the light shining up from the box works well to convey the ''magic'' of christmas/ebay/receiving a parcel. Only minor issue would be that there appears to be a colour cast on the stuffing and bubble wrap (especially in the lower half of the frame) which to some extent makes the shot feel flatter than perhaps it should', '2007-12-17 04:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4318029, 622565, 68035, '<td valign="top">Yep, I know that feeling from buying stuff on ebay.  Lovely and interesting shot that meets the challenge well</td>', 'Yep, I know that feeling from buying stuff on ebay.  Lovely and interesting shot that meets the challenge well', '2007-12-17 04:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4318034, 622738, 68035, '<td valign="top">I love the idea of buying an ''origami boulder'' on ebay.<br/> <br/>Nice composition and creation of leading diagonal lines.  Not sure if it is just because of the lighting but the colours seem a tad flat to me, which means that the shot perhaps lacks a great ''pop''</td>', 'I love the idea of buying an ''origami boulder'' on ebay. Nice composition and creation of leading diagonal lines.  Not sure if it is just because of the lighting but the colours seem a tad flat to me, which means that the shot perhaps lacks a great ''pop''', '2007-12-17 04:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4318036, 622063, 68035, '<td valign="top">Love the composition and the colours.  The only problem for me is that the I-pod is slight of in the horizontal to the bottom of the frame.  For some reason this really does make the picture feel off.  I appreciate that comment may sound very pedantic given how small an adjustment is needed but in this instance it is distracting (to me at least) enough to stop a potentially great image realising its full value</td>', 'Love the composition and the colours.  The only problem for me is that the I-pod is slight of in the horizontal to the bottom of the frame.  For some reason this really does make the picture feel off.  I appreciate that comment may sound very pedantic given how small an adjustment is needed but in this instance it is distracting (to me at least) enough to stop a potentially great image realising its full value', '2007-12-17 04:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4318038, 623119, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice bokeh.  I appreciate that you have gone for a softer shot but for my own tastes I would have maybe prfered it to be a but sharper</td>', 'Nice bokeh.  I appreciate that you have gone for a softer shot but for my own tastes I would have maybe prfered it to be a but sharper', '2007-12-17 04:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
