(4318060, 622892, 39430, '<td valign="top">Can you say obsessive compulsive?  The first step to healing is admitting it.  :)  Nice shot, and I like the lighting.  The ferrari laptop is a little out of place here, but very subtle, so it''s not a problem.</td>', 'Can you say obsessive compulsive?  The first step to healing is admitting it.  :)  Nice shot, and I like the lighting.  The ferrari laptop is a little out of place here, but very subtle, so it''s not a problem.', '2007-12-17 05:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4318061, 623026, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice colouring and glow.</td>', 'Nice colouring and glow.', '2007-12-17 05:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4318063, 622648, 39430, '<td valign="top">Contrast is very high here, with the white snow being totally blown out.  I''m not sure how I''d fix it though.  Such a high contrast scene will be very tricky to get it right.  I think the detail in the patchy grass is distracting.  Yeah, I think you should rake up all the snow from miles around and spread it out evenly for this shot.  :)  You can leave some grass in the foreground if you get tired.</td>', 'Contrast is very high here, with the white snow being totally blown out.  I''m not sure how I''d fix it though.  Such a high contrast scene will be very tricky to get it right.  I think the detail in the patchy grass is distracting.  Yeah, I think you should rake up all the snow from miles around and spread it out evenly for this shot.  :)  You can leave some grass in the foreground if you get tired.', '2007-12-17 05:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4318066, 623119, 39430, '<td valign="top">The misty look here is not quite attractive.  Maybe it doesn''t have enough contrast in it?  A little careful editing could bring out more detail in the piece.  Lovely pendant though!</td>', 'The misty look here is not quite attractive.  Maybe it doesn''t have enough contrast in it?  A little careful editing could bring out more detail in the piece.  Lovely pendant though!', '2007-12-17 05:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
