(4318077, 623078, 45631, '<td valign="top">Haha, very cute.  Great shot for this challenge.  Even have the info on the side of the box (nice detail).  How''d you get her to sit so still?  Well done.</td>', 'Haha, very cute.  Great shot for this challenge.  Even have the info on the side of the box (nice detail).  How''d you get her to sit so still?  Well done.', '2007-12-17 05:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
