(4318085, 622063, 39430, '<td valign="top">The first thing that bugs me (apart from the colour) is the box is not quite straight.  Might also be better to arrange it with the coil of wire off the photo, and the earphones writhing back in.</td>', 'The first thing that bugs me (apart from the colour) is the box is not quite straight.  Might also be better to arrange it with the coil of wire off the photo, and the earphones writhing back in.', '2007-12-17 05:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
