(4318367, 623060, 72268, '<td valign="top">only on ebay.</td>', 'only on ebay.', '2007-12-17 09:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4318369, 623078, 72268, '<td valign="top">Awww, I love this picture it is too cute,. The technicals are good too. I like the comp and lighting. and of course the subject. 10 from me</td>', 'Awww, I love this picture it is too cute,. The technicals are good too. I like the comp and lighting. and of course the subject. 10 from me', '2007-12-17 09:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4318371, 622329, 76598, '<td valign="top">I am not so sure about the picture, but it is a very clever play on the risks of eBay</td>', 'I am not so sure about the picture, but it is a very clever play on the risks of eBay', '2007-12-17 09:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4318372, 622971, 72268, '<td valign="top">Good work here.</td>', 'Good work here.', '2007-12-17 09:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4318378, 622641, 85886, '<td valign="top">I know this will sound childish, but "what necklace?" - maybe it''s just me but I find her nipple overpowering in that it distracts from what should be the subject of the photo, the necklace.  A nice photo though but for me it''s hard to say whether you bought the necklace or the model on eBay ;)</td>', 'I know this will sound childish, but "what necklace?" - maybe it''s just me but I find her nipple overpowering in that it distracts from what should be the subject of the photo, the necklace.  A nice photo though but for me it''s hard to say whether you bought the necklace or the model on eBay ;)', '2007-12-17 09:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4318381, 622712, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  I know I don''t have one... cute choice for the challenge.</td>', 'LOL!  I know I don''t have one... cute choice for the challenge.', '2007-12-17 09:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4318383, 623121, 30982, '<td valign="top">Adorable and well composed photograph.  I especially like the fence - adds a nice touch to this.  Can''t say whether or not it really meets the challenge, but I suppose they sell everything on eBay.  I''d just be wary that someone would think the kid came with the snow!</td>', 'Adorable and well composed photograph.  I especially like the fence - adds a nice touch to this.  Can''t say whether or not it really meets the challenge, but I suppose they sell everything on eBay.  I''d just be wary that someone would think the kid came with the snow!', '2007-12-17 09:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4318385, 623121, 53548, '<td valign="top">i like !!!</td>', 'i like !!!', '2007-12-17 09:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4318386, 623078, 85886, '<td valign="top">Forgetting the fact that your model is ridiculously cute, this is a glorious photo.  I love the monochrome and red colour palette but the perspective and context (relevant but not too cluttered) make it a simple but incredibly effective shot.  The only thing stopping me from rating it 10 is that it doesn''t pass the "i''d hang it on my wall test" - but that''s personal taste and not your photo or interpretation.  No doubt there''s some miserable and clueless voters who will vote this 4 or less...but it''s an outstanding shot both in composition and technically.  Well done.</td>', 'Forgetting the fact that your model is ridiculously cute, this is a glorious photo.  I love the monochrome and red colour palette but the perspective and context (relevant but not too cluttered) make it a simple but incredibly effective shot.  The only thing stopping me from rating it 10 is that it doesn''t pass the "i''d hang it on my wall test" - but that''s personal taste and not your photo or interpretation.  No doubt there''s some miserable and clueless voters who will vote this 4 or less...but it''s an outstanding shot both in composition and technically.  Well done.', '2007-12-17 09:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4318388, 622623, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  Nice collection - good way to show the variety of stuff one can find on eBay.  I like the composition and the lighting - white balance may be just a tad on the yellow side, but that''s often monitor-dependent.</td>', 'Heh!  Nice collection - good way to show the variety of stuff one can find on eBay.  I like the composition and the lighting - white balance may be just a tad on the yellow side, but that''s often monitor-dependent.', '2007-12-17 09:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4318389, 622946, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF and good light for this.</td>', 'Nice DOF and good light for this.', '2007-12-17 09:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4318390, 622648, 85886, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  To me it somehow feels ''old school'' - and I can''t put my finger on why.  It''s simple and a beautiful interpretation of the challenge and really works in monochrome.  Perfect crop too imho.  Well done.</td>', 'Great shot.  To me it somehow feels ''old school'' - and I can''t put my finger on why.  It''s simple and a beautiful interpretation of the challenge and really works in monochrome.  Perfect crop too imho.  Well done.', '2007-12-17 09:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4318392, 623119, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a gorgeous piece!  If you really did buy it on eBay, I''m jealous!  I like the softness of this.</td>', 'What a gorgeous piece!  If you really did buy it on eBay, I''m jealous!  I like the softness of this.', '2007-12-17 09:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4318396, 622618, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  I love the way you lit this for the shadows.</td>', 'LOL!  I love the way you lit this for the shadows.', '2007-12-17 09:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4318397, 623031, 53548, '<td valign="top">hahaha.</td>', 'hahaha.', '2007-12-17 09:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4318398, 622372, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice product shot presentation.</td>', 'Very nice product shot presentation.', '2007-12-17 09:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4318399, 623118, 30982, '<td valign="top">What an oddly fascinating creation.  I like the low light, but almost wish we could see it a bit better just because it IS fascinating!</td>', 'What an oddly fascinating creation.  I like the low light, but almost wish we could see it a bit better just because it IS fascinating!', '2007-12-17 09:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4318401, 622329, 53548, '<td valign="top">fits perfectly !</td>', 'fits perfectly !', '2007-12-17 09:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4318408, 623137, 85886, '<td valign="top">In all honesty a really nice try...a really clever attempt but I think you just fell short in that it doesn''t totally convey the new miniature scale - it almost does and I can really see what you''re trying to do but I think the Xmas tree maybe gives away the scale (or perhaps something else, I''m not sure what it is exactly).  It also looks very photoshopped with unsubtle/unnatural DoF changes all over the place.  I know it''s intentional to convey a new scale but it needs to be more subtle and more uniform imho.  Nice try though.</td>', 'In all honesty a really nice try...a really clever attempt but I think you just fell short in that it doesn''t totally convey the new miniature scale - it almost does and I can really see what you''re trying to do but I think the Xmas tree maybe gives away the scale (or perhaps something else, I''m not sure what it is exactly).  It also looks very photoshopped with unsubtle/unnatural DoF changes all over the place.  I know it''s intentional to convey a new scale but it needs to be more subtle and more uniform imho.  Nice try though.', '2007-12-17 09:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4318410, 623026, 65083, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting on these</td>', 'I like the lighting on these', '2007-12-17 09:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4318411, 623138, 85886, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if it''s intentional but the levels and exposure are all really out.  The main subject is also largely obscured.</td>', 'I don''t know if it''s intentional but the levels and exposure are all really out.  The main subject is also largely obscured.', '2007-12-17 09:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
