(4320102, 623127, 87818, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Ukelele strings, eye line, forehead wrinkles and tougue recenter the gaze as the eye hurries to return from the bow line. The viewer''s visual struggle makes a madcap result well suited to the title, subject''s expression, and the mismatched instrument and bow.</td>', 'Excellent. Ukelele strings, eye line, forehead wrinkles and tougue recenter the gaze as the eye hurries to return from the bow line. The viewer''s visual struggle makes a madcap result well suited to the title, subject''s expression, and the mismatched instrument and bow.', '2007-12-18 10:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4320104, 623010, 83313, '<td valign="top">Interesting looking bottle, but otherwise I find it a pretty plain shot. A macro shot at a steep perspective might do well for this. Hmm, there IS a perspective challenge open for submission right now...</td>', 'Interesting looking bottle, but otherwise I find it a pretty plain shot. A macro shot at a steep perspective might do well for this. Hmm, there IS a perspective challenge open for submission right now...', '2007-12-18 10:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
