(4320106, 622345, 83313, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle and lighting. Almost looks like he''s flying.</td>', 'Interesting angle and lighting. Almost looks like he''s flying.', '2007-12-18 10:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4320138, 623079, 87818, '<td valign="top">Good concept and setting. <br/> <br/>Photographer figure is too difficult to pull from the dark treeline. Model is not comfortable in that crossed-legs pose, appears unbalanced. That is the photographer''s responsibility, not hers.<br/> <br/>Use of line is excellent, but the focus on her too distant, and so too small, face is a problem.  <br/> <br/>Model''s plain clothing makes the viewer wonder why the equipment is in use. Is she the photographer''s assistant, standing in for the model, in order to get the lighting correct? Too many questions; the story is unclear.</td>', 'Good concept and setting.  Photographer figure is too difficult to pull from the dark treeline. Model is not comfortable in that crossed-legs pose, appears unbalanced. That is the photographer''s responsibility, not hers. Use of line is excellent, but the focus on her too distant, and so too small, face is a problem.   Model''s plain clothing makes the viewer wonder why the equipment is in use. Is she the photographer''s assistant, standing in for the model, in order to get the lighting correct? Too many questions; the story is unclear.', '2007-12-18 10:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4320139, 622648, 87818, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of contrasting values, focus, and line, rivets the viewer''s attention of the package.</td>', 'Excellent use of contrasting values, focus, and line, rivets the viewer''s attention of the package.', '2007-12-18 10:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4320141, 623037, 87818, '<td valign="top">Assymmtry and repeated points, funnel shape say FAN.</td>', 'Assymmtry and repeated points, funnel shape say FAN.', '2007-12-18 10:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4320147, 623103, 87818, '<td valign="top">Fantastic. I have no idea why I really like this photgraph.</td>', 'Fantastic. I have no idea why I really like this photgraph.', '2007-12-18 10:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4320162, 623117, 87097, '<td valign="top">Super crisp and sharp</td>', 'Super crisp and sharp', '2007-12-18 10:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4320166, 622641, 87818, '<td valign="top">A beautiful model with bad makeup. This is the photographer''s responsibility, not hers. <br/>     We once used polaroid backs for just this situation. You have a digital camera with even greater capabilities. The model''s makeup and the lighting must be adjusted during the shoot. <br/>     Shadow side eye makeup is correct, lighted side is not. Low and high values, and the colors, should be blended to look natural. The forehead and shadow side face need makeup and fill lighting to smooth the skin. Lighted side is perfect.The drape forms a shadow line that changes the shape of the near breast.</td>', 'A beautiful model with bad makeup. This is the photographer''s responsibility, not hers.      We once used polaroid backs for just this situation. You have a digital camera with even greater capabilities. The model''s makeup and the lighting must be adjusted during the shoot.      Shadow side eye makeup is correct, lighted side is not. Low and high values, and the colors, should be blended to look natural. The forehead and shadow side face need makeup and fill lighting to smooth the skin. Lighted side is perfect.The drape forms a shadow line that changes the shape of the near breast.', '2007-12-18 10:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4320167, 623031, 87818, '<td valign="top">Inventive and humorous. Shelf, chair, and computer hold the viewer on the expression of the unhappy purchaser. Sharper focus of subject''s head draws the eye to the scratches, ensuring the laugh. Low perspective tilts the CD shelf, adding disarray that the viewer attributes to the purchase gone wrong. <br/> <br/>As good as any superbowl commercial gag. Professional quality.</td>', 'Inventive and humorous. Shelf, chair, and computer hold the viewer on the expression of the unhappy purchaser. Sharper focus of subject''s head draws the eye to the scratches, ensuring the laugh. Low perspective tilts the CD shelf, adding disarray that the viewer attributes to the purchase gone wrong.  As good as any superbowl commercial gag. Professional quality.', '2007-12-18 10:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4320170, 622892, 87818, '<td valign="top">Spot on. Focus, package edges and screen glow draw the eye to the figure''s triumphant face.</td>', 'Spot on. Focus, package edges and screen glow draw the eye to the figure''s triumphant face.', '2007-12-18 10:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4320179, 621740, 83313, '<td valign="top">Like the zoom blur, otherwise, I''m afraid there would not be much to this.</td>', 'Like the zoom blur, otherwise, I''m afraid there would not be much to this.', '2007-12-18 10:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
