(4320670, 622971, 3746, '<td valign="top">Dont get it.. I am assuming its supposed to be funny but I aint getting the gag. nicely shot &amp; processed image though.</td>', 'Dont get it.. I am assuming its supposed to be funny but I aint getting the gag. nicely shot & processed image though.', '2007-12-18 15:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4320672, 621902, 63269, '<td valign="top">Well... The colors are great, and the lighting is perfect. The focus is splendid too, that shallow DOF makes it look really nice. My only complaint is that the composition somehow makes this photo look a little akward. Perhaps if the watch were sitting differently, or y ou took the photo at a different angle...Excellent try though - other than that this is a splendid shot! :)</td>', 'Well... The colors are great, and the lighting is perfect. The focus is splendid too, that shallow DOF makes it look really nice. My only complaint is that the composition somehow makes this photo look a little akward. Perhaps if the watch were sitting differently, or y ou took the photo at a different angle...Excellent try though - other than that this is a splendid shot! :)', '2007-12-18 15:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4320674, 621555, 63269, '<td valign="top">lol! Great capture. The sepia works well here.</td>', 'lol! Great capture. The sepia works well here.', '2007-12-18 15:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4320676, 623113, 3746, '<td valign="top">See, now this, whilst not the most inspiring photo, really encapsulates this challenge.  This is exactly the stuff I am enjoying seeing, not just some random object with a `catchy` title.   You didnt even need to title this image, it just works.   Simple, effective and dare I say it, brilliant. love it. look forward to seeing whose this is.<br/> <br/>8</td>', 'See, now this, whilst not the most inspiring photo, really encapsulates this challenge.  This is exactly the stuff I am enjoying seeing, not just some random object with a `catchy` title.   You didnt even need to title this image, it just works.   Simple, effective and dare I say it, brilliant. love it. look forward to seeing whose this is. 8', '2007-12-18 15:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
