(4320685, 622568, 3746, '<td valign="top">Shoehorned into this challenge.. just doesn''t work.. you bought coke on ebay, so why this composition and situation? it doesn''t embellish any points about ebay, internet buying or so on.  I can fully understand you trying to replicate some of the previous ribbon winning shots where objects have been dropped in water, but here, its just being used for the sake of it.  poor.  4</td>', 'Shoehorned into this challenge.. just doesn''t work.. you bought coke on ebay, so why this composition and situation? it doesn''t embellish any points about ebay, internet buying or so on.  I can fully understand you trying to replicate some of the previous ribbon winning shots where objects have been dropped in water, but here, its just being used for the sake of it.  poor.  4', '2007-12-18 15:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
