(4320759, 621411, 63269, '<td valign="top">The lighting is great, and so are all the colors! My only complaint here is that the composition is kind of confusing and cluttered. My eyes want to just sort of meander across the photo. Perhaps experimenting with differnt POV''s, angles, and even rearanging the presents in interesting ways might give your photo more impact. Very good try though - the lighting is just right, and has created some very nice tones! :)</td>', 'The lighting is great, and so are all the colors! My only complaint here is that the composition is kind of confusing and cluttered. My eyes want to just sort of meander across the photo. Perhaps experimenting with differnt POV''s, angles, and even rearanging the presents in interesting ways might give your photo more impact. Very good try though - the lighting is just right, and has created some very nice tones! :)', '2007-12-18 15:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
