(4322452, 622831, 65234, '<td valign="top">Have to say I''m a bit skeptical that this is eBay-related.  Looks a bit too much like a live, flying seagull, and there aren''t a lot of live things to be had on eBay.  But I''ll assume it''s a picture of a painting or something (though for that you should have included a frame or bit of wall or something for context).  The tail looks kinda'' cool with the semi-translucent feathers; crop''s a bit tight on top, and the head looks sharp on top in comparison to the rest of the bird.  I do like that the bird has lots of space to fly into on the right.</td>', 'Have to say I''m a bit skeptical that this is eBay-related.  Looks a bit too much like a live, flying seagull, and there aren''t a lot of live things to be had on eBay.  But I''ll assume it''s a picture of a painting or something (though for that you should have included a frame or bit of wall or something for context).  The tail looks kinda'' cool with the semi-translucent feathers; crop''s a bit tight on top, and the head looks sharp on top in comparison to the rest of the bird.  I do like that the bird has lots of space to fly into on the right.', '2007-12-19 08:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322461, 622661, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle, good to see the setup in use as opposed to just sitting around waiting for something to do.  Assuming you were happy with this purchase, though the model (you?) is pretty expressionless.</td>', 'Interesting angle, good to see the setup in use as opposed to just sitting around waiting for something to do.  Assuming you were happy with this purchase, though the model (you?) is pretty expressionless.', '2007-12-19 08:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
