(4322465, 623045, 65234, '<td valign="top">Glad it turned out as expected :-)  You really can''t ask for much more.  Looks like a pretty cool thing to find, too.</td>', 'Glad it turned out as expected :-)  You really can''t ask for much more.  Looks like a pretty cool thing to find, too.', '2007-12-19 08:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322471, 623101, 65234, '<td valign="top">She''s nicely lit; would''ve liked to see a photo of her in the ad to really tie this together.  She looks like she could use a little more headroom in the shot.</td>', 'She''s nicely lit; would''ve liked to see a photo of her in the ad to really tie this together.  She looks like she could use a little more headroom in the shot.', '2007-12-19 08:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322473, 622345, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely sky and nice lighting on the bear.  Looks ike he''s a flying Pooh.</td>', 'Lovely sky and nice lighting on the bear.  Looks ike he''s a flying Pooh.', '2007-12-19 08:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322476, 623113, 65234, '<td valign="top">:::giggle:::  Quite true.  Point very well made.</td>', ':::giggle:::  Quite true.  Point very well made.', '2007-12-19 08:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322480, 623138, 65234, '<td valign="top">Get the idea, which works fine,  but the shot isn''t coming across as dreamy to me, just washed out.</td>', 'Get the idea, which works fine,  but the shot isn''t coming across as dreamy to me, just washed out.', '2007-12-19 08:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322484, 622565, 65234, '<td valign="top">A bit unstable-looking, but the yard is nice.  Really depends on how much you paid ;-)</td>', 'A bit unstable-looking, but the yard is nice.  Really depends on how much you paid ;-)', '2007-12-19 08:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322485, 623121, 81382, '<td valign="top">Buying on ebay is perhaps a little far fetched, but its nice not to vote on another still life. The foot tracks in the otherwise burn out snow almost has a glow and is very well composed although could have pushed the tones a the lower end for a bit more constrast. The fence works well to break up the snow from the background and again is well composed</td>', 'Buying on ebay is perhaps a little far fetched, but its nice not to vote on another still life. The foot tracks in the otherwise burn out snow almost has a glow and is very well composed although could have pushed the tones a the lower end for a bit more constrast. The fence works well to break up the snow from the background and again is well composed', '2007-12-19 08:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322492, 623137, 65234, '<td valign="top">Fascinatingly narrow focal plane you''ve got here.  I don''t think I could do that.  Anyway, interesting idea.</td>', 'Fascinatingly narrow focal plane you''ve got here.  I don''t think I could do that.  Anyway, interesting idea.', '2007-12-19 08:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322500, 622943, 67001, '<td valign="top">Nice pic. A wooden table might have been better. I am not sure about this blanket.</td>', 'Nice pic. A wooden table might have been better. I am not sure about this blanket.', '2007-12-19 08:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322501, 622723, 81382, '<td valign="top">A bit of a blatent long exposure thing going on which is a bit of a shame as it almost says to me you had tried doing two entries concurrently and at the last minute entered this in the ebay catagory, rather than executing a single, well considered concept. The border is overly complex and inteferes with the hoizontal lines made by the top of the screen. The speaker area of the screen is aliasing which is a bit distracting. Even though I''ve knocked the long exposure effect, it is pretty good and might have been better with a computer game on the screen and a can of red bull on the table and entered into the other competition</td>', 'A bit of a blatent long exposure thing going on which is a bit of a shame as it almost says to me you had tried doing two entries concurrently and at the last minute entered this in the ebay catagory, rather than executing a single, well considered concept. The border is overly complex and inteferes with the hoizontal lines made by the top of the screen. The speaker area of the screen is aliasing which is a bit distracting. Even though I''ve knocked the long exposure effect, it is pretty good and might have been better with a computer game on the screen and a can of red bull on the table and entered into the other competition', '2007-12-19 08:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322502, 623137, 67001, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture!</td>', 'Very nice picture!', '2007-12-19 08:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322505, 622031, 81382, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones and warm hue and emphasised by the lighting. Not just a boring still life, the subject is interesting and quiet entertaining and you also have the chickens in shot which beefs up the difficulty factor. Best one I''ve voted on so far</td>', 'Lovely tones and warm hue and emphasised by the lighting. Not just a boring still life, the subject is interesting and quiet entertaining and you also have the chickens in shot which beefs up the difficulty factor. Best one I''ve voted on so far', '2007-12-19 08:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322507, 623039, 67001, '<td valign="top">Why didn''t you walk down to a better seat? The place is empty!  :-)</td>', 'Why didn''t you walk down to a better seat? The place is empty!  :-)', '2007-12-19 08:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322508, 622770, 67001, '<td valign="top">Oh no!</td>', 'Oh no!', '2007-12-19 08:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322510, 623135, 65234, '<td valign="top">You know, I bet it is rare.  It even has a little curly hair on it, which you don''t see on your average penguin figurine, and it''s little beak is broken (adds character, right?).  You can find the darndest things on eBay!</td>', 'You know, I bet it is rare.  It even has a little curly hair on it, which you don''t see on your average penguin figurine, and it''s little beak is broken (adds character, right?).  You can find the darndest things on eBay!', '2007-12-19 08:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322515, 622971, 81382, '<td valign="top">I can fully understand the effort and time required to produce this but it almost works against you in that it appears perhaps overly setup. Its almost like a theatrical production image to be used inside a programme with the melodramatic expressions. Composition seems a little unbalanced and a bit heavy on the right hand side. Lovely PP burning work, would be interested in seeing the original.</td>', 'I can fully understand the effort and time required to produce this but it almost works against you in that it appears perhaps overly setup. Its almost like a theatrical production image to be used inside a programme with the melodramatic expressions. Composition seems a little unbalanced and a bit heavy on the right hand side. Lovely PP burning work, would be interested in seeing the original.', '2007-12-19 08:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322516, 623111, 65234, '<td valign="top">Pretty sparkles and bokeh, and nice background color.  Doesn''t actually look old, but it''s pretty.</td>', 'Pretty sparkles and bokeh, and nice background color.  Doesn''t actually look old, but it''s pretty.', '2007-12-19 08:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322518, 623023, 81382, '<td valign="top">Clever concept, I just dont think technically this is brilliant enough to make the top ten and has quite a low difficulty factor</td>', 'Clever concept, I just dont think technically this is brilliant enough to make the top ten and has quite a low difficulty factor', '2007-12-19 08:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322520, 622770, 65234, '<td valign="top">That would certainly make for some unusual shots, don''t you think?  Like having a built-in the-subject-is-falling-apart filter.  very rare.  Probably worth a fortune!</td>', 'That would certainly make for some unusual shots, don''t you think?  Like having a built-in the-subject-is-falling-apart filter.  very rare.  Probably worth a fortune!', '2007-12-19 08:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322525, 622723, 65234, '<td valign="top">Good one, too.  I got mine (Nikon version) on eBay :-)  Nice capture of getting caught up in a bidding war.</td>', 'Good one, too.  I got mine (Nikon version) on eBay :-)  Nice capture of getting caught up in a bidding war.', '2007-12-19 08:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322528, 623117, 81382, '<td valign="top">The main subject is pretty complex and so having a relatively complicated background (despite being blurred) and a textured reflective surface, the whole image is pretty busy. I bet it didn''t compress well and you may have had to step down the jpeg quality a fair amount to get under the 150K limit - in my limited experience on this site, the clean and simple ones work the best. If this was taken from a lower viewpoint, with a wider angle looing up against a neutral background, the horse would be much better isolated and I''m certain would have scored higher - good luck.</td>', 'The main subject is pretty complex and so having a relatively complicated background (despite being blurred) and a textured reflective surface, the whole image is pretty busy. I bet it didn''t compress well and you may have had to step down the jpeg quality a fair amount to get under the 150K limit - in my limited experience on this site, the clean and simple ones work the best. If this was taken from a lower viewpoint, with a wider angle looing up against a neutral background, the horse would be much better isolated and I''m certain would have scored higher - good luck.', '2007-12-19 08:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322533, 623037, 81382, '<td valign="top">The second ebay/long exposure combo I''ve seen and again I''m saying would have been better if entered into the other competition. Having said that, lovely colours and contrast, well composed and makes for an interesting abstract</td>', 'The second ebay/long exposure combo I''ve seen and again I''m saying would have been better if entered into the other competition. Having said that, lovely colours and contrast, well composed and makes for an interesting abstract', '2007-12-19 09:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322534, 623078, 65234, '<td valign="top">Some seller is in BIG trouble if you bought that cutie on eBay!  Nice idea, though, and very cooperative model.</td>', 'Some seller is in BIG trouble if you bought that cutie on eBay!  Nice idea, though, and very cooperative model.', '2007-12-19 09:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322546, 622725, 65234, '<td valign="top">Did she have to eat her way out?  Don''t think I care for the candies arranged so neatly on her forehead, as it detracts from the "what do I do with all these?" implied by the randomness of the rest of them.  Also, what''s that vertical bar of light in her eyes?  I think I would have cloned it out.</td>', 'Did she have to eat her way out?  Don''t think I care for the candies arranged so neatly on her forehead, as it detracts from the "what do I do with all these?" implied by the randomness of the rest of them.  Also, what''s that vertical bar of light in her eyes?  I think I would have cloned it out.', '2007-12-19 09:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322551, 623075, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting phone.  Don''t think I''ve ever seen one quite like it.</td>', 'Interesting phone.  Don''t think I''ve ever seen one quite like it.', '2007-12-19 09:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322559, 623107, 65234, '<td valign="top">You aren''t complaining about receiving cute chocolate, are you?  That''s completely adorable, and edible, besides.  Worth every penny, I''m sure :-)</td>', 'You aren''t complaining about receiving cute chocolate, are you?  That''s completely adorable, and edible, besides.  Worth every penny, I''m sure :-)', '2007-12-19 09:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322563, 622943, 65234, '<td valign="top">That looks intimidating.  Kind of a nice decoration, though.  I think I would have gone sepia all the way on this, as I don''t think the colored pattern on the fabric enhances the subject.</td>', 'That looks intimidating.  Kind of a nice decoration, though.  I think I would have gone sepia all the way on this, as I don''t think the colored pattern on the fabric enhances the subject.', '2007-12-19 09:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322570, 622936, 65234, '<td valign="top">Pretty colors in the sky, although a trifle oversaturated on my monitor.  Without the title I wouldn''t have guessed champagne, though.  Bubbles aren''t blatant enough.</td>', 'Pretty colors in the sky, although a trifle oversaturated on my monitor.  Without the title I wouldn''t have guessed champagne, though.  Bubbles aren''t blatant enough.', '2007-12-19 09:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322571, 622935, 65234, '<td valign="top">It does pay to notice what the listing doesn''t say as well as what it does.  Could be an expensive lesson ;-)</td>', 'It does pay to notice what the listing doesn''t say as well as what it does.  Could be an expensive lesson ;-)', '2007-12-19 09:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322575, 623037, 65234, '<td valign="top">Um, doesn''t look like one.  OK as an abstact, though I''d crop more off the bottom to make it match the left in terms of distance from the circle to the edge.</td>', 'Um, doesn''t look like one.  OK as an abstact, though I''d crop more off the bottom to make it match the left in terms of distance from the circle to the edge.', '2007-12-19 09:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322585, 623060, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cute one :-)</td>', 'Cute one :-)', '2007-12-19 09:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322588, 623117, 65234, '<td valign="top">THAT is unique!</td>', 'THAT is unique!', '2007-12-19 09:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322593, 622738, 65234, '<td valign="top">:::giggle:::  Entertaining idea.</td>', ':::giggle:::  Entertaining idea.', '2007-12-19 09:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322598, 622031, 65234, '<td valign="top">Wow; I will be sure to look for one of those if I ever get chickens.  Including them really makes this shot. Wonder what the horseshoe does?</td>', 'Wow; I will be sure to look for one of those if I ever get chickens.  Including them really makes this shot. Wonder what the horseshoe does?', '2007-12-19 09:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322601, 622199, 65234, '<td valign="top">But the sparks are pretty!  Besides, I''m betting the seller didn''t say it *wouldn''t* catch on fire, now did he?</td>', 'But the sparks are pretty!  Besides, I''m betting the seller didn''t say it *wouldn''t* catch on fire, now did he?', '2007-12-19 09:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322603, 622934, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oops.  More assembly than anticipated?  Great expression, BTW.</td>', 'Oops.  More assembly than anticipated?  Great expression, BTW.', '2007-12-19 09:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322610, 622688, 65234, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen similar listings :-)  Great idea.</td>', 'I''ve seen similar listings :-)  Great idea.', '2007-12-19 09:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322611, 623026, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, beautifully lit.</td>', 'Very pretty, beautifully lit.', '2007-12-19 09:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322614, 622712, 65234, '<td valign="top">Um, me?  But you clearly did!  She could use a bit plainer background to really show her off.</td>', 'Um, me?  But you clearly did!  She could use a bit plainer background to really show her off.', '2007-12-19 09:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322618, 622143, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice socks!  Fun idea :-)</td>', 'Very nice socks!  Fun idea :-)', '2007-12-19 09:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322622, 622788, 65234, '<td valign="top">Not likely, but lovely shot of the ring.</td>', 'Not likely, but lovely shot of the ring.', '2007-12-19 09:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322630, 622892, 65234, '<td valign="top">Addict!  Excellent idea for this challenge.  Perfectly portrays the middle-of-the-night bidding addict who buys things he clearly doesn''t need,</td>', 'Addict!  Excellent idea for this challenge.  Perfectly portrays the middle-of-the-night bidding addict who buys things he clearly doesn''t need,', '2007-12-19 09:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322642, 623121, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great shot; did you buy a snowmaking machine?</td>', 'Great shot; did you buy a snowmaking machine?', '2007-12-19 09:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322643, 623038, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nicely random assortment of things.</td>', 'Nicely random assortment of things.', '2007-12-19 09:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322647, 621628, 65234, '<td valign="top">How very literal :-)  Great idea.</td>', 'How very literal :-)  Great idea.', '2007-12-19 09:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322651, 623031, 65234, '<td valign="top">Almost missed the claw marks on your face.  Love the feedback you''re giving!</td>', 'Almost missed the claw marks on your face.  Love the feedback you''re giving!', '2007-12-19 09:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322655, 622329, 65234, '<td valign="top">Fabuous idea :-)  A little too much light on the dress, but a perfect take on the challenge.</td>', 'Fabuous idea :-)  A little too much light on the dress, but a perfect take on the challenge.', '2007-12-19 09:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322673, 623114, 65234, '<td valign="top">I can''t actually see them well on my monitor, so I''m having a hard time figuring out what you''re trying to show me here.</td>', 'I can''t actually see them well on my monitor, so I''m having a hard time figuring out what you''re trying to show me here.', '2007-12-19 09:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322687, 623074, 65234, '<td valign="top">I bought fish on eBay!  Mosquito fish for my outdoor water barrel garden.  They multiplied.  Yours are prettier than mine.  Reflections on the fishies are a bit harsh, but I know it''s hard to get decent pictures of fish ''cuz they insist on staying underwater and moving about all the time!</td>', 'I bought fish on eBay!  Mosquito fish for my outdoor water barrel garden.  They multiplied.  Yours are prettier than mine.  Reflections on the fishies are a bit harsh, but I know it''s hard to get decent pictures of fish ''cuz they insist on staying underwater and moving about all the time!', '2007-12-19 09:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322695, 623012, 65234, '<td valign="top">And you can put them on anything!  Who could resist?  Very nice almost-still life :-)  Would have liked a little fill light to reduce the shadows.</td>', 'And you can put them on anything!  Who could resist?  Very nice almost-still life :-)  Would have liked a little fill light to reduce the shadows.', '2007-12-19 09:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322701, 622894, 65234, '<td valign="top">If you don''t want that kind, I''ll gladly take it!  Gorgeous eyes.  The seller should be banned for life for selling a cat on eBay, but still a very cute idea on your part.</td>', 'If you don''t want that kind, I''ll gladly take it!  Gorgeous eyes.  The seller should be banned for life for selling a cat on eBay, but still a very cute idea on your part.', '2007-12-19 09:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322710, 622826, 65234, '<td valign="top">ROFLMAO!!!  Love the details in your ad.  Back to bump.  Definitely my favorite in the challenge :-)</td>', 'ROFLMAO!!!  Love the details in your ad.  Back to bump.  Definitely my favorite in the challenge :-)', '2007-12-19 09:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322840, 622723, 72929, '<td valign="top">At least you''re using Firefox lol. Nice concept, I like it. The blurred hands adds some dynamic to the shot.</td>', 'At least you''re using Firefox lol. Nice concept, I like it. The blurred hands adds some dynamic to the shot.', '2007-12-19 10:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322843, 622143, 35804, '<td valign="top">OMG...I just choked on my drink...10</td>', 'OMG...I just choked on my drink...10', '2007-12-19 10:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322845, 621317, 72929, '<td valign="top">With advanced editing this pic would''ve looked a lot better with some sort of cartoonish or sketch type modification. Great capture though.</td>', 'With advanced editing this pic would''ve looked a lot better with some sort of cartoonish or sketch type modification. Great capture though.', '2007-12-19 10:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322850, 622934, 72929, '<td valign="top">Cheap piece of #$%^! haha</td>', 'Cheap piece of #$%^! haha', '2007-12-19 10:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322853, 623113, 72929, '<td valign="top">Hahaha</td>', 'Hahaha', '2007-12-19 10:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322925, 622568, 83313, '<td valign="top">You bought a bottle of coke on Ebay? Cool looking water splash. Perhaps a touch more sharpening would have give it some more impact. These do look like glass bottles, but I thought the glass bottled ones were green. It always seems to taste better out of the green glass bottles.</td>', 'You bought a bottle of coke on Ebay? Cool looking water splash. Perhaps a touch more sharpening would have give it some more impact. These do look like glass bottles, but I thought the glass bottled ones were green. It always seems to taste better out of the green glass bottles.', '2007-12-19 10:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322943, 621555, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like this. Nice stop motion.</td>', 'I like this. Nice stop motion.', '2007-12-19 11:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322948, 622756, 83313, '<td valign="top">He actually looks a little irritated. I think he is glaring at me until I give him a high vote.</td>', 'He actually looks a little irritated. I think he is glaring at me until I give him a high vote.', '2007-12-19 11:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322957, 622315, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice macro shot with subtle but effective bokeh background. I am not nearly so good at wrapping gifts. The crop seems just a touch too tight at the bottom for me.</td>', 'Nice macro shot with subtle but effective bokeh background. I am not nearly so good at wrapping gifts. The crop seems just a touch too tight at the bottom for me.', '2007-12-19 11:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322965, 623118, 83313, '<td valign="top">Somewhat indistinct to me. Possibly the result of having to scale down to 640 pixels. It appears to be a sculpture made from spark plugs and other parts?</td>', 'Somewhat indistinct to me. Possibly the result of having to scale down to 640 pixels. It appears to be a sculpture made from spark plugs and other parts?', '2007-12-19 11:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322967, 623031, 83313, '<td valign="top">No pets allowed where you live?</td>', 'No pets allowed where you live?', '2007-12-19 11:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322975, 623078, 83313, '<td valign="top">Did it come with assembly instructions? Cute and nicely done. The single splash of color is effective.</td>', 'Did it come with assembly instructions? Cute and nicely done. The single splash of color is effective.', '2007-12-19 11:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4322979, 622329, 52285, '<td valign="top">Lol!!!</td>', 'Lol!!!', '2007-12-19 11:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4323019, 623123, 83313, '<td valign="top">That got purchased online? Glad I was not the delivery driver that had to explain it.</td>', 'That got purchased online? Glad I was not the delivery driver that had to explain it.', '2007-12-19 11:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4323047, 623028, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice, though I don''t care for the strong golden color cast. I suppose it does fit the Christmas morning title, however.</td>', 'Nice, though I don''t care for the strong golden color cast. I suppose it does fit the Christmas morning title, however.', '2007-12-19 11:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4323048, 623031, 67001, '<td valign="top">A cleaner room could have made the photo more interesting... I find that the photo relies too much on the title.</td>', 'A cleaner room could have made the photo more interesting... I find that the photo relies too much on the title.', '2007-12-19 11:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4323050, 622930, 67001, '<td valign="top">I hate you already!  :-)</td>', 'I hate you already!  :-)', '2007-12-19 11:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4323052, 623038, 67001, '<td valign="top">Cluttered...</td>', 'Cluttered...', '2007-12-19 11:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4323132, 623125, 83313, '<td valign="top">A good try, but it''s lacking appeal. Not a lot of detail showing on the camera itself. Some adjustment with curves or shadow/highlight may have brought it out. Sorry</td>', 'A good try, but it''s lacking appeal. Not a lot of detail showing on the camera itself. Some adjustment with curves or shadow/highlight may have brought it out. Sorry', '2007-12-19 11:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4323133, 623121, 67001, '<td valign="top">You did not buy snow from eBay. You just happened to have a nice pic of your child and tried to make it fit the challenge. DNMC. I will however award some points because it is an interesting photo. I like the "crooked" tracks and composition. I find that the snowsuit is a bit too over saturated though. Nice shot, but out of context.</td>', 'You did not buy snow from eBay. You just happened to have a nice pic of your child and tried to make it fit the challenge. DNMC. I will however award some points because it is an interesting photo. I like the "crooked" tracks and composition. I find that the snowsuit is a bit too over saturated though. Nice shot, but out of context.', '2007-12-19 11:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4323143, 622063, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the comp and the clashing colors. Some good work with the lighting. I think you did a good job of capturing the metallic finish. Not an Ipod fan myself, though I do have a modest collection of other brands of MP3 players.</td>', 'I like the comp and the clashing colors. Some good work with the lighting. I think you did a good job of capturing the metallic finish. Not an Ipod fan myself, though I do have a modest collection of other brands of MP3 players.', '2007-12-19 11:53:46.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4323146, 622565, 83313, '<td valign="top">Shoehorn alert! A good pic though.</td>', 'Shoehorn alert! A good pic though.', '2007-12-19 11:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4323172, 623072, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very nice and festive looking. I see a lot of what is either noise or compression artifacts, though. Highly visible on the blue and purple ornaments.</td>', 'Very nice and festive looking. I see a lot of what is either noise or compression artifacts, though. Highly visible on the blue and purple ornaments.', '2007-12-19 12:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4323192, 622063, 63269, '<td valign="top">The bright colors look really nice against the black background. It might be neat to unwind the earplug cords and loop them around in more interesting designs... just a thought. :)</td>', 'The bright colors look really nice against the black background. It might be neat to unwind the earplug cords and loop them around in more interesting designs... just a thought. :)', '2007-12-19 12:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4323199, 623023, 63269, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot - my only suggestion would be to crop less tightly and not cut off the "victim''s" arm. Somehow it seems to make the composition a little akward. Also, the photo might look nicer with a bit more contrast and some color adjustments. Otherwise this is a very nice photo! :) Hope this was helpful.</td>', 'This is a good shot - my only suggestion would be to crop less tightly and not cut off the "victim''s" arm. Somehow it seems to make the composition a little akward. Also, the photo might look nicer with a bit more contrast and some color adjustments. Otherwise this is a very nice photo! :) Hope this was helpful.', '2007-12-19 12:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4323200, 621411, 83313, '<td valign="top">Doggie looks happy. Does he get to play with the Wii? I''m afraid this photo looks like a snapshot with a nice camera. Perhaps different lighting may have helped. The shadows are unappealing at the angle they are at, especially the one behind the tree.</td>', 'Doggie looks happy. Does he get to play with the Wii? I''m afraid this photo looks like a snapshot with a nice camera. Perhaps different lighting may have helped. The shadows are unappealing at the angle they are at, especially the one behind the tree.', '2007-12-19 12:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
