(4323208, 623111, 83313, '<td valign="top">Cool looking details. Unfortunately, my eye is being drawn up the ball, toward the out of focus section. If the further part of the ball was in focus and the foreground blurry, that may have worked better for me.  Too bad macros have such a problem with DOF.</td>', 'Cool looking details. Unfortunately, my eye is being drawn up the ball, toward the out of focus section. If the further part of the ball was in focus and the foreground blurry, that may have worked better for me.  Too bad macros have such a problem with DOF.', '2007-12-19 12:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4323211, 623074, 63269, '<td valign="top">Some of the highlights look a little blown and overexposed here. Perhaps the flash was too close or to bright? If there was any way to fix that, that might increase the impact of the photo. Otherwise, nice shot! :)</td>', 'Some of the highlights look a little blown and overexposed here. Perhaps the flash was too close or to bright? If there was any way to fix that, that might increase the impact of the photo. Otherwise, nice shot! :)', '2007-12-19 12:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
