(4323216, 622641, 83313, '<td valign="top">NWS!!!</td>', 'NWS!!!', '2007-12-19 12:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4323226, 622712, 63269, '<td valign="top">Well, here''s my two cents. :)<br/> <br/>First of all, it is kind of hard to tell exactly what this is. I would suggest shooting this from a different angle, and perhaps creating an unusual composition to grab the viewer''s interest. Also, the image looks a little bit over-exposed. If you used your flash, you might want to consider backing up a little bit, or if possible lowering the strenth of the flash. This would help fix some of the blown-out highlights on the front of the subject. Another thing is the background... a plain, simple background might make your image look less like a snapshot... I hope all this was helpful! :)</td>', 'Well, here''s my two cents. :) First of all, it is kind of hard to tell exactly what this is. I would suggest shooting this from a different angle, and perhaps creating an unusual composition to grab the viewer''s interest. Also, the image looks a little bit over-exposed. If you used your flash, you might want to consider backing up a little bit, or if possible lowering the strenth of the flash. This would help fix some of the blown-out highlights on the front of the subject. Another thing is the background... a plain, simple background might make your image look less like a snapshot... I hope all this was helpful! :)', '2007-12-19 12:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4323228, 623092, 63269, '<td valign="top">Oh beautiful! Those tones are just exquisite... and combined with the subtle colors and nice textures, it all adds up for a really nice photo. I love it! :)</td>', 'Oh beautiful! Those tones are just exquisite... and combined with the subtle colors and nice textures, it all adds up for a really nice photo. I love it! :)', '2007-12-19 12:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
