(4326556, 623028, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love the concept here, but there''s a few things I personally might try to fix. First of all, the light coming from the box is a bit too bright, and makes the box over-exposed. If there had been any way to fix that, that might have helped... also, the overal color of the picture is a little bit too yelowish. Perhaps the white balance setting needed adjustment? Hope this was helpful! :) Very neat idea.</td>', 'I love the concept here, but there''s a few things I personally might try to fix. First of all, the light coming from the box is a bit too bright, and makes the box over-exposed. If there had been any way to fix that, that might have helped... also, the overal color of the picture is a little bit too yelowish. Perhaps the white balance setting needed adjustment? Hope this was helpful! :) Very neat idea.', '2007-12-20 16:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
