(4327180, 622329, 67697, '<td valign="top">You are just a nut and I am LAUGHING.  Great idea for the challenge. Your expression says it all.  You get what you pay for, eh?  Although, I can tell you, I would not pay $50 for that dress lol.  Good luck!</td>', 'You are just a nut and I am LAUGHING.  Great idea for the challenge. Your expression says it all.  You get what you pay for, eh?  Although, I can tell you, I would not pay $50 for that dress lol.  Good luck!', '2007-12-20 23:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
