(4331249, 623121, 72318, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice shot, but personally i dont think snow is something you can buy on eBay (i just typed in both snow and "real snow" and nothing came up) - at least not like you are portraying in the image. Sorry, i am the first to hate DNMC comments but this is pushing it. Cant give more than a 6 for this, sorry.</td>', 'This is a really nice shot, but personally i dont think snow is something you can buy on eBay (i just typed in both snow and "real snow" and nothing came up) - at least not like you are portraying in the image. Sorry, i am the first to hate DNMC comments but this is pushing it. Cant give more than a 6 for this, sorry.', '2007-12-23 15:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4331255, 622946, 72318, '<td valign="top">Ok - there is a DPC tradition of taking shots of a HD but i cant see the "faulty" bit of this... And the grain doesnt really add to the image, nor does the oof foreground imo. :(   Composition is nice tho.</td>', 'Ok - there is a DPC tradition of taking shots of a HD but i cant see the "faulty" bit of this... And the grain doesnt really add to the image, nor does the oof foreground imo. :(   Composition is nice tho.', '2007-12-23 15:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4331260, 623119, 72318, '<td valign="top">Loads of JPeg artifacts is an instant turn off for me.. also the pendant seems to be hidden behind a haze of sorts possibly because of the light source off to the left :(</td>', 'Loads of JPeg artifacts is an instant turn off for me.. also the pendant seems to be hidden behind a haze of sorts possibly because of the light source off to the left :(', '2007-12-23 15:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4331261, 623114, 72318, '<td valign="top">The bokeh is nice apart from the harsh bit above and to the left of the statuettes, also they arent completely in focus which throws the viewer as it is obviously all the same subject and thus should be treated as such :(</td>', 'The bokeh is nice apart from the harsh bit above and to the left of the statuettes, also they arent completely in focus which throws the viewer as it is obviously all the same subject and thus should be treated as such :(', '2007-12-23 15:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4331262, 622063, 72318, '<td valign="top">Improvement would be aligning the iPod with the borders, the slight offset is unsettling in such a geometric subject. Nice idea.</td>', 'Improvement would be aligning the iPod with the borders, the slight offset is unsettling in such a geometric subject. Nice idea.', '2007-12-23 15:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4331269, 622641, 72318, '<td valign="top">Hrm - there is a red cast to the shadowed side of her face on my screen, it also seems as if you are just putting in nakedness for votes as such a photo is not allowed in the eBay TOS so cant be an example of a photo you might use to buy an item on eBay, nor does it demonstrate the product in a "natural" environment...<br/>Not saying that it isnt a nice photo, the composition/pose and lighting is good, but it just doesnt feel right in this challenge to me.</td>', 'Hrm - there is a red cast to the shadowed side of her face on my screen, it also seems as if you are just putting in nakedness for votes as such a photo is not allowed in the eBay TOS so cant be an example of a photo you might use to buy an item on eBay, nor does it demonstrate the product in a "natural" environment...Not saying that it isnt a nice photo, the composition/pose and lighting is good, but it just doesnt feel right in this challenge to me.', '2007-12-23 15:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4331271, 623079, 72318, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of the silhouette in the foreground - mainly because it isnt immediately apparent what it is. But great idea, and a nice alround shot.</td>', 'Not a fan of the silhouette in the foreground - mainly because it isnt immediately apparent what it is. But great idea, and a nice alround shot.', '2007-12-23 15:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4331274, 622937, 72318, '<td valign="top">Sadly worth nothing these days despite all the hype surrounding them... i worked for iSold It two summers ago and a woman came in wanting £3000 for her collection, we had a hard time selling groups of them for 1/4 of their combined retail price!!<br/>Anyway - photo - nice idea, composition and execution. Just lacks the "wow" factor :)</td>', 'Sadly worth nothing these days despite all the hype surrounding them... i worked for iSold It two summers ago and a woman came in wanting £3000 for her collection, we had a hard time selling groups of them for 1/4 of their combined retail price!!Anyway - photo - nice idea, composition and execution. Just lacks the "wow" factor :)', '2007-12-23 15:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
