(4332184, 622887, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nope, I had no idea who Chad Morgan is, but I just figured he was a singer with bad teeth.  And I was right! :)  This is a very cute shot, Brian - hold onto it for when you need to keep him in line as a teenager!</td>', 'Nope, I had no idea who Chad Morgan is, but I just figured he was a singer with bad teeth.  And I was right! :)  This is a very cute shot, Brian - hold onto it for when you need to keep him in line as a teenager!', '2007-12-24 01:30:24.000000', NULL, 0),
