(4332464, 623092, 28710, '<td valign="top">I like this pic. I feel it''s underrated. I like the colors, the contrast and the way the eye moves around due to the shallow DOF following the 3D aspect of the textures. A beautiful pic that would look great in a tasteful frame on top of the piano. <br/> <br/>Nothing quite like a beautiful girl playing skillfully on a piano in a small room. It''ll put shivers in your bones and speckle your skin with the notes of emotions.</td>', 'I like this pic. I feel it''s underrated. I like the colors, the contrast and the way the eye moves around due to the shallow DOF following the 3D aspect of the textures. A beautiful pic that would look great in a tasteful frame on top of the piano.  Nothing quite like a beautiful girl playing skillfully on a piano in a small room. It''ll put shivers in your bones and speckle your skin with the notes of emotions.', '2007-12-24 06:20:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4332466, 623039, 28710, '<td valign="top">I thought this image was of the people in the overhead display. Oddly, I couldn''t find them in the nosebleeds. Perhaps the message was conveyed a bit less than clearly...</td>', 'I thought this image was of the people in the overhead display. Oddly, I couldn''t find them in the nosebleeds. Perhaps the message was conveyed a bit less than clearly...', '2007-12-24 06:22:59.000000', NULL, 0),
