(4332475, 622329, 67152, '<td valign="top">Jon - You are a complete nut.  <br/> <br/>I love this shot - the serious face works very well.  By the way, the sheen of the dress really complements your eyes.  You should wear this color more often.  I am just not sure of the choice of shoes.<br/></td>', 'Jon - You are a complete nut.   I love this shot - the serious face works very well.  By the way, the sheen of the dress really complements your eyes.  You should wear this color more often.  I am just not sure of the choice of shoes.', '2007-12-24 06:35:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4332482, 623026, 68035, '<td valign="top">Not vintage?  No bought on ebay????  I am putting a complaint to the SC immediately!!!<br/> <br/>Seriously many congratulations on the ribbon another of your truely great images.  The composition is spot on and the duotone conversion is magnificent, giving the baubles a wonderfully fragile look to them without having sacrificed any sharpness or clarity in achieving a soft look about it<br/> <br/>Thoroughly deserved ribbon....<br/> <br/>Wishing you a fantastic Christmas and a happy, peaceful, prosperous and most of all healthy 2008<br/> <br/>Jon</td>', 'Not vintage?  No bought on ebay????  I am putting a complaint to the SC immediately!!! Seriously many congratulations on the ribbon another of your truely great images.  The composition is spot on and the duotone conversion is magnificent, giving the baubles a wonderfully fragile look to them without having sacrificed any sharpness or clarity in achieving a soft look about it Thoroughly deserved ribbon.... Wishing you a fantastic Christmas and a happy, peaceful, prosperous and most of all healthy 2008 Jon', '2007-12-24 06:51:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4332484, 623026, 67152, '<td valign="top">Congrats Karen.  This is an excellent image and I am sure glad you were rewarded for it</td>', 'Congrats Karen.  This is an excellent image and I am sure glad you were rewarded for it', '2007-12-24 06:55:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4332486, 622688, 43774, '<td valign="top">Remember when I said in the forums there were better photos in the challenge than mine.....I meant this one!!! I thought for sure it would finish in 1st or 2nd place. Congrats on the ribbon!</td>', 'Remember when I said in the forums there were better photos in the challenge than mine.....I meant this one!!! I thought for sure it would finish in 1st or 2nd place. Congrats on the ribbon!', '2007-12-24 06:56:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4332487, 622315, 68035, '<td valign="top">Haha, well its good to know that me in a purple bridesmaid dress is 0.05 more attractive than a box and gold ribbon!!!<br/> <br/>I thought this was a lovely shot, I liked the low key image and you brought the ribbon out beautifully<br/> <br/>Perfect for the challenge, and lovely for the time of year</td>', 'Haha, well its good to know that me in a purple bridesmaid dress is 0.05 more attractive than a box and gold ribbon!!! I thought this was a lovely shot, I liked the low key image and you brought the ribbon out beautifully Perfect for the challenge, and lovely for the time of year', '2007-12-24 06:58:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4332489, 622912, 68035, '<td valign="top">To hell with the score, this is one of your fantastic surreal and to be honest slightly scary images which I have become accustomed to.<br/> <br/>I bet you this suffered at the hands of speed voters who did not spot the face in the metalwork<br/> <br/>Many congratulations on the evolution to working in RAW (perhaps appropriately giving the title of the image)<br/> <br/>Weird and wonderful</td>', 'To hell with the score, this is one of your fantastic surreal and to be honest slightly scary images which I have become accustomed to. I bet you this suffered at the hands of speed voters who did not spot the face in the metalwork Many congratulations on the evolution to working in RAW (perhaps appropriately giving the title of the image) Weird and wonderful', '2007-12-24 07:01:25.000000', NULL, 0),
