(4333419, 622641, 29906, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bleu:</b></div><hr/><i> Why is this womans breast showing?</i></td></tr></table> <br/>What a silly question! One answer: Grow up.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bleu:</b></div><hr/><i> It is really confusing and distracts from the necklace. Tighter crop (w/o the boob) and it would be a good image. She does not look very happy with the necklace. Best of luck. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The challenge is not about a necklace. I don''t see you criticizing the blue ribbon shot that the 4 men are distracting from the potato, assuming you can even see the potato!</td>', 'Originally posted by bleu: Why is this womans breast showing? What a silly question! One answer: Grow up. Originally posted by bleu: It is really confusing and distracts from the necklace. Tighter crop (w/o the boob) and it would be a good image. She does not look very happy with the necklace. Best of luck.   The challenge is not about a necklace. I don''t see you criticizing the blue ribbon shot that the 4 men are distracting from the potato, assuming you can even see the potato!', '2007-12-24 17:28:56.000000', NULL, 0),
